{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "5708bfd858bb4181aa80751e97e4ff78b15a4cfd561e02070e51af4910612e53", "ja": "不穏な最終日", "zh": "不祥的最后一天", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1a1b1ad848a7758a8cd652ac22a360420d2e90fbd580b8eb1463058df5b68c11", "ja": "島での撮影が終わり、船の出発時間が迫る。\nしかし茜の姿が見当たらない。全員で探して\nみると、茜は食堂に隠れていた。この時間を\n終わらせたくないと訴える茜を、志保とエレ\nナが説得、全員で東京に帰るのだった。", "zh": "在岛上的拍摄结束，开船的时间也越来越近了。\n然而却到处都找不到茜的身影。大家四处寻找\n后，发现茜正躲在食堂里。面对倾诉着不想让\n这段时光结束的茜，志保和艾莲娜劝说成功，\n最后所有人一起回到了东京。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "59f6a20188d9ac98d7a016f1c7beee0d1c69fab7fd162e3aeba2884a7726388d", "ja": "（島での撮影が全て終わり、東京に帰る日が来た。\n終わると、あっという間だなと思っていたら……）", "zh": "（岛上的拍摄全部结束了，回东京的日子也到了。\n正想着结束之后还真是一眨眼的工夫……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "91708f167b75af77f5f59768bdf4b2abf21e68f62090e356881bde9f4cb32a26", "ja": "アカネ～。アカネ、どこに行っちゃったノ～？\n……{$P$}、見つからないヨー。", "zh": "茜～。茜，你跑到哪里去了呢～？\n……{$P$}，我找不到茜了哟——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1002_p", "source_sha256": "86ff3b06c257551a0ac6c3151031b0dc142e50707d5a4c6af8a4e7894bee8c9f", "ja": "そうか、困ったな。\n船が出るまで、あまり時間がないのに……。", "zh": "这样啊，真伤脑筋。\n明明离开船的时间已经没多少了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1003_p", "source_sha256": "7f8c6bc07f9acc0558896e7922530a6c7a9030519207473aaeab6b5f4c582ae1", "ja": "（出発の集合時間になっても、茜の姿が見えない。\nこんな時に、一体どこに行ったんだ？）", "zh": "（到了出发集合的时间，却还是没看到茜的身影。偏偏在这种时候，她到底跑哪儿去了？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "eeeb32316cb1410696a45c9ae0e6ccd4e21789364627d16636fe07f26e75fce4", "ja": "茜さんが、荷物をまとめて出ていくところは見ました。\nでも、その後までは……。", "zh": "我看到茜收拾好行李出去了。\n但是，她后来去了哪里……我就不知道了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1005_052kao", "source_sha256": "fa4f76d4b47cae486e8abb5a6f1c153cd20c7f9bab108019ad8d52115aaa61f0", "ja": "どうしましょうか、{$P$}さん。\nこの船を逃すと、次は夕方ですよね？", "zh": "该怎么办呢，{$P$}先生。\n要是错过这班船，下一班就是傍晚了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ecd9952c5f3a300254cf9b94860e0f2ace7d1a205ebd5c057352f4c3c4c83a66", "ja": "ええ……帰りが遅くなると、後の予定にも響くので、\n最悪の場合は俺だけ残ろうと思います。", "zh": "嗯……要是回去晚了，也会影响之后的安排，所以最坏的情况下，我打算只留下我一个人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1007_p", "source_sha256": "9211ccedc5c9226ed2cc885cac7efde68c2b893f5dce042a86e994e8d5826d13", "ja": "すまないけど、みんなも\n茜を探すのを手伝ってくれるか？", "zh": "不好意思，大家也能帮忙找找茜吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1008_038chz", "source_sha256": "629041f35e31bbe6ea65687ae05d95ff83afafb3d51450edeffc5b7d0b531aa8", "ja": "もちろんですわ！　エレナと志保は、建物の中を。\nわたくしは歌織さんと、外を探しますわ！", "zh": "那是当然！艾莲娜和志保负责建筑物内部。\n我和歌织小姐负责在外面找！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1009_009rit", "source_sha256": "2f51957ba9f7e255cb8874187f9eb4c6522a6384b945a97e6ea072e7069b3cea", "ja": "千鶴さん、{$P$}。\n私達はどこを探しましょう？", "zh": "千鹤小姐，{$P$}。我们该去哪里找？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1010_p", "source_sha256": "3f876319cb70bfa01cc91b82c15b2ea69f16737b8b7d85ce0f739910665b7daa", "ja": "律子と伊織は、ここで荷物を見ていてくれ。\nもしかしたら茜が戻ってくるかもしれないし……。", "zh": "律子和伊织，你们留在这里看行李吧。\n茜说不定会回来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1011_007ior", "source_sha256": "5d2f03e805821ad9609be14c3f91e50ee8314c41b962519103812d5db2c2c143", "ja": "わかったわ。しっかり茜を\n探してきなさいよね、{$P$}！", "zh": "知道了。你可要好好把茜找回来啊，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1012_p", "source_sha256": "0a1498ff841c295c988e7f4956540739376cdfc057f5524d6f784e1378e6fdf3", "ja": "ああ、もちろんだ！", "zh": "好，当然没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1013_p", "source_sha256": "64ab6019e4da27d4f996df117bb27bb7d5a453ad392c350c785a03575c817244", "ja": "おーい、茜！　どこにいるんだー！", "zh": "喂——茜！你在哪儿——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1014_033sih", "source_sha256": "bd6563874ccb1a97c62e6cf3190cebc2b0e38de999f5471e4ac304c613c2497c", "ja": "茜さん、いたら返事してくださいー！\n……こんなに呼んでも、返事がないなんて……。", "zh": "茜小姐，如果你在的话请回答——！……都叫了这么多声了，居然还是没有回应……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1015_p", "source_sha256": "62abd19934f755d06c7c1cb218cb0613de0620005f7b739bbe9921d22736a8dd", "ja": "（あちこち探しているが、茜の姿はない。これじゃ\nまるで、映画が現実になったみたいじゃないか……）", "zh": "（虽然找遍了各个地方，却还是没看到茜的身影。这简直就像电影变成现实了一样……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "f595c7315609edc91a4c4045e20cdd58c75a26e077eab0f68eb20ca3764d91a5", "ja": "あーーーーっ！？　いた、アカネ！\n{$P$}、見つけたヨー！", "zh": "啊————！？茜，在这边！\n{$P$}，我找到她了唷——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1017_p", "source_sha256": "e64f344caa1ed289d214696061035948a020e50cb6d69ac8b0e4aedb9cda0d26", "ja": "！　エレナの声……どこからだ！？", "zh": "！是艾蕾娜的声音……是从哪里传来的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1018_033sih", "source_sha256": "a6a816d26a45123a0d6e2c924bc4c9616aedfcbf068ffac310c679867e2cbd95", "ja": "食堂です、{$P$}さん！\n急ぎましょう！", "zh": "在食堂，{$P$}先生！我们快过去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1019_p", "source_sha256": "9b394bd3988fe184f128c5e1a07862a58e4ac9cedf720ab2f6b7d6b229a002e9", "ja": "（茜はずっと、食堂に隠れていたらしい。\n確かに見つけづらい場所だけど……）", "zh": "（茜好像一直都躲在食堂里。确实是个很难找到的地方，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1020_p", "source_sha256": "4cd930e6eb61769e362544619ee4ac886d60cc847495362a5dbafb123a896513", "ja": "茜。もう帰りのフェリーが出る時間なんだ。\n早く行かないと、帰れなくなるぞ。", "zh": "茜，已经到返程的渡轮要出发的时间了。\n不快点过去的话，就回不去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1021_023aka", "source_sha256": "08781d3ee64d705b04555c934e34dd774b0cd4ca0cddcdfaad5bf206ab43d34a", "ja": "……たくない。", "zh": "……不想回去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1022_018ele", "source_sha256": "533d6c78c11a513a2dea29d9ee4ce58357d4040b880fbf31b1dc603efb31a537", "ja": "アカネ……。", "zh": "茜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1023_023aka", "source_sha256": "5cd315ae890aa6c53f52e5ca824d8d846d7947b8595dff47cbf36e3e018c14ac", "ja": "帰りたくないっ！\nっていうか！　茜ちゃんは、帰らないよっ！", "zh": "不想回去！\n应该说，小茜才不回去呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1024_033sih", "source_sha256": "9560f486426ce912a079e6cdaa43fc68aeb02a75441d9d6cdbdf6d9601bbb75c", "ja": "帰りたくないって、茜さん……。", "zh": "不想回去什么的，茜小姐……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1025_023aka", "source_sha256": "219210b1200ffa17efb4dc07cd7e24d5e330240c77c27e02a68f8cd8c0b68ba5", "ja": "帰りたくないって言ったら、帰りたくないの！\n茜ちゃん、ずっとこの島にいる！", "zh": "说不想回去就是不想回去嘛！\n小茜要一直留在这座岛上！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1026_p", "source_sha256": "03cc3262fc25cfd187428d83866439499c13aface15ea2fc46d3f1f39f6c4542", "ja": "いくら景色が良くても、ここじゃ茜は暮らせないだろ。\nコンビニもプリンもないんだし……。", "zh": "就算风景再好，茜也没法在这里生活吧。\n这里既没有便利店，也没有布丁……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1027_023aka", "source_sha256": "7001083084ccdf11402b1de47247f5ba594dae93d4d0c5383d963bb8f24e3d7d", "ja": "プリンは、卵と牛乳とお砂糖があればつくれるもん！", "zh": "只要有鸡蛋、牛奶和砂糖，就能做布丁！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1028_018ele", "source_sha256": "821ab74a969ea7489a6b0c217beb07e372841aa1af8f0fa8bf5457787512220f", "ja": "アカネ、ずっとこの調子なんだヨ。\n島に残るんだーって……。", "zh": "茜一直都是这个样子啦。\n总说要留在岛上——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1029_p", "source_sha256": "b7538e7aecc1e3477452f801c50ea1df9e0e5133b0a77fd793dd9fbf55f82372", "ja": "茜。映画の撮影は終わったのに、\nどうして島に残りたいんだ？", "zh": "茜，电影的拍摄都结束了，为什么还想留在岛上？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1030_023aka", "source_sha256": "76c2ebf9a77cbc776df22ca889a4a3df76940a4e3f036ac8f3bdba4f0496bb4a", "ja": "だって……だって島から出たら、\n茜ちゃんの主役が終わっちゃうもん！", "zh": "因为……因为一离开这座岛，小茜的主角就当到头了嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1031_023aka", "source_sha256": "a90eec0fa70a89b02965f99fa19f353555a36f13d3c1dd196d04fdd55cc94810", "ja": "映画の主人公なんて、人生でそう何度もある話じゃ\nないでしょ。茜ちゃん、選ばれてすごくうれしかった。", "zh": "电影主角这种事，人生中可没有几次机会的。被选中，真的好开心。小茜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1032_018ele", "source_sha256": "533d6c78c11a513a2dea29d9ee4ce58357d4040b880fbf31b1dc603efb31a537", "ja": "アカネ……。", "zh": "茜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1033_033sih", "source_sha256": "67496fc0107df87ec7904581da9f49bc84ecc2f052fbaf2c8ba4857b7eac295c", "ja": "茜さん……。", "zh": "茜小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1034_023aka", "source_sha256": "f12323e88cff42be239b8273adecd1d17da59277dd8eab39dfe2e24124bb83c2", "ja": "茜ちゃん帰りたくない。\nこの時間を終わらせたくないよ……。", "zh": "小茜我不想回去。我不想让这段时光结束……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1035_p", "source_sha256": "e2087e0be6e25d1b184af7201a7e01f3c0435488958a1c6a66d37ea9a5668b65", "ja": "茜、この時間を終わらせたくないのはわかるけど……\nでも東京に戻らないと、肝心の映画は完成しないぞ？", "zh": "茜，我知道你不想让这段时光结束，可是……要是不回东京，最重要的电影就没法完成了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1036_023aka", "source_sha256": "da657b020079f2e73b8c0be03319105ad01789365a9a2c82d675e0c6751bbb66", "ja": "そんなの、茜ちゃんだってわかってるもん！\nでも、でも……。", "zh": "这种事，小茜当然知道啦！\n可是，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1037_023aka", "source_sha256": "10cd756f78fadfc7054a8dd7c9f1dd6049b43c022ce0dd3b5804054ae90e3e63", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃんはアイドルじゃないから\n茜ちゃんの気持ちなんてわからないよ！", "zh": "{$P$}又不是偶像，\n怎么会懂小茜的心情嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1038_p", "source_sha256": "bb948eb4fd6fb2daeda4b503a44f66cdeb7f51a8219704a1e6a6722ef3ad0ca3", "ja": "茜……。", "zh": "茜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1039_033sih", "source_sha256": "5339cad6c3f026eb9378218f3f581d84013527bbd3904ce3e7b5446a9c35d421", "ja": "……あの、{$P$}さん。\nここは、私に任せてもらえませんか？", "zh": "……那个，{$P$}先生。\n这里，能交给我来处理吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1040_033sih", "source_sha256": "7728287de07a0be01bccee37dc2e82f8ee56bc1267910e440d2a9870f6222f32", "ja": "私も、茜さんに言いたいことがあるんです。", "zh": "我也有话想对茜小姐说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1041_p", "source_sha256": "4223141cea286a19ec74c2c96ab7512b385caf0ea29631ff9aba6e1154499516", "ja": "……わかった。志保に任せるよ。", "zh": "……我知道了。就交给你了，志保。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1043_033sih", "source_sha256": "885b2e9f4abbaea8754ee8bd1789fbfdac9103178dc8a9ab7d5cdf66ed186d04", "ja": "茜さん。……茜さんが言うように、撮影中の茜さんは、\n主役として、とても輝いていたと思います。", "zh": "茜小姐……正如你所说，我觉得拍摄中的你作为主角，真的非常耀眼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1045_033sih", "source_sha256": "63cd04b4f56149512e467e9a4cc9affb49a7f27a88387d6161456899fcfe012a", "ja": "私は今回の映画、完成がすごく楽しみです。\n自分が出演したというのも、もちろんありますけど。", "zh": "我非常期待这部电影完成。当然，自己也出演了也是原因之一，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1046_033sih", "source_sha256": "50364cee6a3b719d0de9a62be0ce848b0450d0fcb99398f57dbce85e3d812f92", "ja": "一番の理由は、たくさんの人に……それから、私の\n家族に、茜さんやみんなを観てほしいと思うからです。", "zh": "最重要的理由是，我希望很多人……还有我的家人，都能看到茜小姐和大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1047_023aka", "source_sha256": "5820af385bb4c540074d9040cb054bb846d15d795e6fd58bbe15c1e533dc653a", "ja": "え……しほりん……？", "zh": "诶……志保酱……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1048_033sih", "source_sha256": "2c3045c88f89658e3dc1a5e6c03823fc833e2f9a47a6bef2d4ec3aaa2800bca4", "ja": "サスペンスホラーで、怖いお話ですから。\n弟は、最後まで見られないと思いますけど……。", "zh": "因为是悬疑恐怖题材，内容很吓人。\n弟弟应该看不到最后，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1049_033sih", "source_sha256": "1e7cf09daedbaa1662a57542834bcf203d90cc8422c51519e68a1361ec4d0f76", "ja": "けど、きっとわかってくれると思います。\n私のいる劇場の人達は、こんなにすごいんだってこと。", "zh": "不过，我想他一定会明白的。明白我所在的剧场里的大家，都是这么厉害的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1050_033sih", "source_sha256": "97d27060c977e42d4d92fcf8d776da6d7bc18e5d7d2a7e4502a978bb588b2c46", "ja": "プリンの作り方を教えてくれたのは、\nこのお姉ちゃん達なんだよってことも……。", "zh": "还有，教我做布丁的也是这些姐姐们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1051_018ele", "source_sha256": "06dfe0de50cd5c0ca95414ea80a9f7eed5c9a4c471a23ea6b4d42d417188a1f2", "ja": "……アカネ！　ワタシも、シホと同じだヨ！\nたくさんの人に、映画を観てほしいって思ってるヨ！", "zh": "……茜！我也和志保一样哦！\n我希望有很多人来看这部电影！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1052_018ele", "source_sha256": "30f3c08c5ca30a58fe5b4575ee2f4d18858c1e5a8877997b5decdd06bb97172a", "ja": "それに、主人公は1回なんて、決まってないもん！\nこれから何回だってあるはずだヨ！　ね、シホ？", "zh": "而且，也不是已经决定好要当1次主人公了嘛！今后肯定还会有很多次的！对吧，志保？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1053_033sih", "source_sha256": "2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55", "ja": "はい。", "zh": "是的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1054_023aka", "source_sha256": "b45be67569f6b1ef56c1d4aa49b6dc9094120e162a4cc0f1e014313d15002a39", "ja": "しほりん……エレナちゃん……。", "zh": "志保……艾莲娜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1055_023aka", "source_sha256": "7950c929e79548a2d9383b5838be93858d26a48a9aceae2d3728867c42b9a5d6", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん……\nみんな、ありがと……。", "zh": "{$P$}……\n大家，谢谢你们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1056_p", "source_sha256": "fbb16f423e3c36f071bc9ee3d83978eb00431b42117453e50f1a04bd676a2e1f", "ja": "（エレナと志保が茜に寄り添う事ができるのは、\n同じアイドルだから。そして、俺にできる事は……）", "zh": "（爱丽娜和志保能够陪在茜身边，是因为她们同为偶像。而我能做到的事是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1057_p", "source_sha256": "94a26122f0084738c03a965dafdaaaa60762c4da484258747420647f09a39b23", "ja": "（プロデューサーとして、アイドル達の\n可能性を信じて、背中を押す事。それだけだ！）", "zh": "（作为制作人，我能做的只有相信偶像们的可能性，为她们推上一把！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1059_038chz", "source_sha256": "63ef1c646f8f7336cde6a35c14fec4baaa5e971293593fca4d09b99f898f169f", "ja": "無事、みつかったようですわね。……いいところを、\n子ども達に持っていかれてしまいましたわね？", "zh": "看来是平安找到了呢……最精彩的部分，被孩子们抢先了呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_06_1060_052kao", "source_sha256": "5b4b8ed93eb1d0c77a5fa816a46cd6816a2173f4d551e5ecc0eb654a1d397333", "ja": "ええ。本当によかった……。\n私たちも、迎えに行きましょうか。", "zh": "嗯，真的太好了……  \n我们也去接他们吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
